    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale twena nga bwe tuli n'abadhulizi kamaala batyo abatwezungulwire, tusuule ere kiisi kintu ekituzitoogherera era n'ekibi ekitwesibyeku. Tungire n'obumalirivu mu ntaka edh'okulumuka edhiteereibwagho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'amaiso tugataire ku Yesu eyatoolereza era atuukiriza okwikiriza kwaife. Oyo olw'eisanhu lye yali asuubira, yagumira omusalaba, yaaloba kutya kuswala. Mperaano atyaime ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'ekityamo kya Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhukire bwe yagumira okutakana n'obukyayi obw'aboonooni, olwo mulobenga kuwaamu maani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba waire mulwana n'ekibi, mukaali kutuuka ku kwitibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerabiire Katonda bw'abalamba ng'abaana be? Akoba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe mukangaivulwanga, muguminkirizenga, kuba Katonda abakangaivula ng'abaana be. Kale mwana ki ise y'atakangaivula? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe mutakangaivulwa ng'abandi bwe bakangaivulwa, muba nga timuli baana beene aye muba ng'abaghambule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo nga kiri agho, twali ni balata baife mu mubiri abaatukangaivulanga era twabatangamu ekitiisa. Kale titugwaine kugondera Lata waife mu mwoyo kusingagho inho tube abalamu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balata baife abo baatukangaivulanga ekiseera kitono nga beene bwe baabonanga. Aye Katonda atukangaivula olw'omuganhulo ife beene gwe tufunamu, tughange okugabana ku butukuvu bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe tuba nga tuli kukangaivulwa, mu kiseera ekyo tuwulira bulumi mu kifo eky'eisanhu. Aye oluvainhuma abeegereseibwa okukangaivulwa okwo, bafuna emiraala n'obutuufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mugolole emikono gyaimwe egiruyiriire, mugumye ebivu byaimwe ebidhugumira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.35.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 35:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutambulirenga mu ngira enkalamu, aghenhera alobe kulemalira irala aye awone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufaabiikanenga okuba n'emiraala y'abantu boonaboona era mufaabiikanenga okuba n'obutukuvu, kuba aghazira obwo, ghazira alibona Musengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwekuume ghalobe kubaagho afiirwa kisa kya Katonda, era ghalobe kubaagho bubi buva mu imwe ni butabulatabula era ni bwonoona bantu kamaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwekuume ghalobe kubaagho mwenzi oba atatya Katonda ng'Esau, eyatunda obusika bwe olw'omwiguto omulala guti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.29+GEN.25.30+GEN.25.31+GEN.25.32+GEN.25.33+GEN.25.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 25:29-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhi nga ku nkomerero bwe yayenda okufuna omukisa ogwo, tiyagugheebwa, kuba tiyafuna kaghagaanhia ka kukyusa kye yali akoze, waire yagunoonia ng'alira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.27.30+GEN.27.31+GEN.27.32+GEN.27.33+GEN.27.34+GEN.27.35+GEN.27.36+GEN.27.37+GEN.27.38+GEN.27.39+GEN.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 27:30-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
