        },
        {
          "text": "Aye imwe mwidhie ku lusozi Sioni era mu kibuga kya Katonda omulamu, Yerusalemu eky'omu igulu, eyeesololeiza bamalaika olukunkumuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhie mu lwekobaano olw'abaana ababeri abaaghandiikibwa mu igulu, ni ye Katonda omulamuzi w'abantu boonaboona, era ni y'emyoyo gy'abatuufu abaafuulibwa abatuukiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhie ye Yesu eyakwania endagaano empyaka. Mwidhie y'omusaayi ogumansirwa, ogwogera ebikalamu okusinga ogwa Abeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
